<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.26 pct, 3-mo 22.19 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 22.26 pct, 3-mo 22.19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) rose slightly for the one-month maturity and eased a touch for the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.26 percent, up 0.01 percent. The three-month rate was at 22.19 percent, down 0.01 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
